{"trial_id": "heatmap_regulation_subdomain_001_20260505_112527", "task_id": "heatmap_regulation_subdomain", "trial_number": 1, "category": "coverage", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "Show the clause count, total normative intensity, and average NI for each subdomain-regulation pair", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Regulation)-[:HAS_CLAUSE]->(c:Clause)-[:MAPPED_TO]->(sd:SubDomain) RETURN sd.subDomainId AS subDomainId, sd.name AS subDomainName, r.regulationId AS regulationId, r.label AS regulationName, count(c) AS clauseCount, sum(c.normativeIntensity) AS totalNormativeIntensity, avg(c.normativeIntensity) AS avgNormativeIntensity ORDER BY sd.subDomainId, r.regulationId;", "success": true, "attempt_count": 2, "llm_answer": "Here is the structured breakdown of **clause count, total normative intensity (NI), and average NI** for each **subdomain-regulation pair**, based on the query results:\n\n---\n\n### **1. Data at Rest Encryption (D-01.1)**\n| **Regulation**                     | **Clause Count** | **Total NI** | **Avg NI** | **Regulatory Pressure** |\n|------------------------------------|------------------|--------------|------------|-------------------------|\n| **Cyber Resilience Act (CRA)**     | 1                | 2            | 2.0        | SHALL (strong)          |\n| **Digital Operational Resilience Act (DORA)** | 1          | 3            | 3.0        | SHALL (strongest)       |\n| **General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)** | 2          | 3            | 1.5        | Mixed (1x SHALL, 1x SHOULD) |\n| **NIS2**                           | 1                | 2            | 2.0        | SHALL                   |\n\n**Key Insight**: DORA imposes the highest normative intensity (SHALL) for data-at-rest encryption, while GDPR has a lower average NI due to mixed clause types.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Data in Transit Encryption (D-01.2)**\n| **Regulation**                     | **Clause Count** | **Total NI** | **Avg NI** | **Regulatory Pressure** |\n|-------------------------